  "description": "<p>This task is a follow-on to:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1640\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1640</a></p>\n\n<p>Specifically, see comment:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/869#issuecomment-129077939\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/869#issuecomment-129077939</a></p>\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Create a binary resource in the HTML UI\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/image\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/image</a></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>Create a version of that resource<br/>\ncurl -i -XPOST -H\"slug: v0\" <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/image/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/image/fcr:versions</a></li>\n\t<li>GET the triples for the versioned resource<br/>\ncurl -i  <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/image/fcr:versions/v0/fcr:metadata\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/image/fcr:versions/v0/fcr:metadata</a>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Notice triples have subject of &lt;resource&gt;/fcr:metadata instead of &lt;resource&gt;</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
